Package: octawave
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Octahedral Quantum Wave Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Katharina", "Brecht", email = "katharina.quantumdata@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2176-7476"))
Description: Provides mathematical tools for simulating and visualizing three-dimensional octahedral quantum wave interferences and spatial resonance fields. Includes functions for MRI slice generation of fullerene structures and wave models.
